                        "review": "I lover having my own retro arcade. \nemulated games can be a little tricky to sert up.\n\nEasyiest way to get your arcade set up is to folow this guide.\n\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/Vive/comments/7b3k3h/for_newcomers_to_vr_who_grew_up_in_the_80s90s/\n\nor search for \n\nFor newcomers to VR who grew up in the 80s/90s, check out New Retro Arcade!!\n\n\nAlmost all controllers work.\n\nGet a arcade game controller for the best experience.\n\nThere is a lot of support from the community for this arcade all you need to do is look.\n",
